| 250K | 5.71 | 5.52–6.13 (p95 6.79) | 16.45 | 15.34–18.30 (p95 18.74) | **2.88x** | 9.31 | 2.146944e-8 | WIN | 67.35ms |
| 1M | 6.53 | 6.29–6.79 (p95 7.40) | 44.00 | 39.07–47.07 (p95 49.79) | **6.74x** | 11.07 | 1.516660e-9 | WIN | 162.70ms |

